[{"timestamp": "2025-10-30T05:57:19Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "Gulal", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T05:57:28Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Hazaaron Khwahihen", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T05:57:29Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Oh", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T05:57:34Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The End", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T05:57:36Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Anurag tooo?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:02:00Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "😒 ‎video omitted", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:05:58Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Communication in memes and gifs should become mainstream.\nBut not too mainstream. Day before yesterday in court I almost said - “but after doing X, the complainant went …. “ (AWOL).\nThen like what Vella lawyers do. My friend and I discussed for 15 minutes on whether AWOL would have been acceptable or not. And whether AWOL is more formal or MIA. 🫢", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:06:57Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "My friend hit me wit Ety of AWOL on how it’s a military accepted term and therefore formal.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:07:00Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Could've been worse. You could have said, the complainant went Taxi no. 9211.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:07:41Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Trust me to come up with the worse thing to say in any situation. Years of practice.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:08:17Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "In my first moot court, I went. \"The counsel pleads incompetence on this, Your Lordship\"", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:11:26Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Reminds me of this meme ‎image omitted", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:12:19Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "But legal commmunication throws some absolute entertainers", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:12:45Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Still better than one friend of mine who instead of using the words “approach the bench” went like “the counsel would request to come closer, your lordship” ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:13:44Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "If you hate Japanese rice wine, it is definitely the former.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:14:16Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Judge: \"I thought you'd never say that 🥹\"", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:14:24Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Or Sanjay Dutt and Koena Mitra in an item song", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:14:39Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "In a case for employment termination. The employee / consultant sent a notice to my client saying -\n“Your client exploited me and terminated my contract immediately after I did my bit. Like I was a curry leaf in a rasam. “", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:15:16Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "I should have that somewhere let me find.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:15:23Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "More like drumsticks in Sambhar. Hate those. Why are you putting wood in my food?!", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:16:41Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "There was another one such gold. Another law person I knew instead of using the word “convenience” went like “my competing counsel is resorting to the truth of connivance, my Lord”", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:16:53Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "nd also this. ‎image omitted", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:17:07Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Why are you sleeping like a Kumbhakarna", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:19:41Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Not a fair analogy. Over 3 years Kumbhakarna would have woken up 6 times. ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:20:00Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "I was just typing another anecdote re this", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:20:40Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "In court once. A judge reprimanded a party behaviour and said - “sorry. You can’t sleep like KK and the come to court and cry foul. “", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T06:21:06Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "And immediately corrected himself and said - sorry. Not KK. Because he would still wake up once in a while. You are RIP Van Winkle", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:02:07Z", "username": "Anurag Bhide", "text": "Has changed now in the last 1.5 years since subsidy process has been streamlined to a national portal. MH has crossed GJ, UP also will soon.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:36:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Heresy", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:37:42Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Pita stop", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:37:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Dakar (hindi) rally 😂", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:40:06Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Withdrawing machines?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:41:39Z", "username": "Saara", "text": "Withdrawal symptoms?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:41:49Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Tellonus Prime?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:42:34Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Power Outages", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T08:43:10Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Fuse voltage", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"ti